<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-FAI Life reports flat half yr net.</title>
<headline>RTRS-FAI Life reports flat half yr net.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996. (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   11.95  vs  8.95</p>
<p>    Net				     5.55  vs  5.59</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    3.0   vs  3.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Life insurer FAI Life is about 42 percent owned by FAI Insurances Ltd.  </p>
<p>    Sales				  70.47  vs  69.41</p>
<p>    Other income			 47.82  vs  23.26</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   4.9   vs    5.2</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			nil   vs    nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 83.3 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date March 26</p>
<p>Reg date March 12</p>
<p>    Tax				     6.40  vs    3.36</p>
<p>    Interest expense		  862,000 vs  14,000</p>
<p>    Depreciation			960,000 vs 851,000</p>
<p>    Minorities			     nil  vs    nil</p>
</text>
